1.1 OpenBLAS kernels - src/blas/narrow_kernels.cpp, src/blas/simd_kernels.hpp
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The narrow dgemm kernels of hsolve's BLAS hook (module src/blas; linked into the hsolve executable
by default, and built as libhsolve_blashook.so) adapt the structure of these OpenBLAS 0.3.34 files:
  * kernel/x86_64/dgemv_n_microk_skylakex-4.c (the NN column-group update)
      Copyright (c) 2014, The OpenBLAS Project
  * kernel/x86_64/dgemm_small_kernel_nn_skylakex.c (the register path of NN calls with few rows:
    accumulators over all of k), kernel/x86_64/dgemm_small_kernel_tn_skylakex.c (the TN register
    block and its REDUCE_4 reduction)
      Copyright (c) 2021, The OpenBLAS Project
The small triangular solve of the hook is hsolve's own code (loop orders of the reference BLAS).
