(docs/DEPENDENCIES.md has versions and uses):
  * GoogleTest 1.18 (C++ unit tests): BSD-3-Clause, Copyright 2008, Google Inc.
  * NumPy 2.4 / SciPy 1.17 (case generators, evaluation, baselines; runtime dependencies of the
    Python front end, not linked into it): BSD-3-Clause.
  * Comparison baseline environment os2026-ref (tools/bench): PETSc / SLEPc 3.26
    (BSD-2-Clause), MUMPS 5.8.2 MPI (CeCILL-C), PT-SCOTCH (CeCILL-C), ParMETIS (University of
    Minnesota license, non-profit research only). Its Open MPI 5 and libfabric 1.22 are also what
    hsolve-mpi links on the cluster nodes: section 3.7.
  * BLAS experiments (tools/deps, built from pinned source tarballs, never distributed with
